cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software in work you publish, please cite the paper it
  implements.
title: "vulntool"
abstract: >-
  Measures how exposed each species in a forest census is to local extinction,
  accounting for the buffering effect of a patchy spatial distribution.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/davideb321/vulntool"
